.Sh STANDARDS
FIPS 203 (ML-KEM), RFC 5869 (HKDF), RFC 8439 (ChaCha20-Poly1305),
FIPS 202 (SHA3-256), and FIPS 204 and FIPS 205 for the signature.
The chunked encryption is the STREAM construction of Hoang, Reyhanitabar,
Rogaway and Vizar.
